cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and cite the archived deposit whose results you reproduce (see README, How to cite)."
title: "certlab: exact synthesis of small Boolean circuits by SAT, with DRAT-certified lower bounds"
abstract: >-
  SAT encoders for exact synthesis of single-output Boolean functions in the AIG, XAG and MIG
  bases (circuit and formula modes), a certification chain whose lower bounds are UNSAT results
  with drat-trim-verified DRAT proofs, NPN canonicalisation for 4-input functions, and scripts
  that regenerate published forced-reconvergence witnesses from scratch.
authors:
